  "description": "Add vintage charm to your designs with this Retro Cocktail Clipart Bundle featuring 32 stylish summer drink illustrations. Discover tiki mugs, gin and tonic bottles, whiskey on the rocks, highball glasses, old fashioned cocktails, citrus garnishes, and classic bar quotes. Perfect for party invitations, bar cart prints, t-shirt designs, stickers, sublimation, and summer branding. These high-quality retro graphics are ideal for DIY projects, Cricut crafts, and commercial use creations.\nYou’ll receive:\n✔ 32 PNG files\n✔ 300 DPI resolution\n✔ Size: 4096 x 4096 px\n✔ Transparent background\nPerfect for:\n✔ Scrapbooking and journaling\n✔ Invitations and cards for birthdays\n✔ Backgrounds for digital planners\n✔ Kids’ craft projects\n✔ Any DIY project that needs a fun and colorful touch",
